# Tailscale — domain lines carry extended-matching so RULE-SET hits TLS SNI
# when always-real-ip makes the socket look like IP:443 (otherwise → FINAL).
# Updating this ruleset alone is enough; conf line need not change.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tailscale.com,extended-matching
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tailscale.net,extended-matching
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ts.net,extended-matching
DOMAIN,controlplane.tailscale.com,extended-matching
DOMAIN,log.tailscale.com,extended-matching
DOMAIN,login.tailscale.com,extended-matching
